# The Nix daemon socket is enabled through a preset rather than `systemctl enable` at
# build time: the Fedora nix-daemon unit lives under the Nix profile in /nix, which on
# this ostree system is a bind mount of /var/nix populated at boot, so the unit is not
# visible to systemctl while the image is built. A preset is declarative and is applied
# when the unit exists, so systemd enables the socket on first boot once nix.mount has
# made /nix available.
enable nix-daemon.socket
